<custom-nav title="我的资料与隐私" back />
<view class="page">
  <view class="title">我的资料与隐私</view>
  <view class="page-note">
    <view class="muted">
      修改后的资料将在管理员审核通过后展示，审核期间仍展示原资料。展示开关保存后立即生效，联系电话不向其他成员展示。
    </view>
    <navigator url="/pages/privacy/index" class="link">查看个人信息保护指引</navigator>
  </view>
  <load-status loading="{{loading && !profile}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="load" />
  <block wx:if="{{profile}}">
    <view
      wx:if="{{review.status === 'PENDING' || review.status === 'REJECTED'}}"
      class="card profile-review"
    >
      <view class="section">
        {{review.status === 'PENDING' ? '已提交，等待管理员审核' : '资料修改未通过'}}
      </view>
      <view class="muted">
        {{review.status === 'PENDING' ?
        '下方为本次提交的资料，管理员审核通过后才会更新展示，审核期间老乡录仍展示原资料。再次提交将替换本次待审内容。'
        : '原资料继续展示，请根据审核意见修改后重新提交。'}}
      </view>
      <!-- prettier-ignore -->
      <text wx:if="{{review.publicReason}}" class="profile-review-reason" selectable>{{review.publicReason}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{review.status === 'APPROVED'}}" class="muted">
      最近一次资料修改已审核通过。
    </view>
    <profile-form
      value="{{profile}}"
      phone-editable="{{false}}"
      disabled="{{saving || !canEdit}}"
      bind:change="change"
    />
    <view class="muted">联系电话不能在此修改。如需协助，请通过帮助与反馈联系运营组。</view>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="row spread">
        <view class="grow">允许在老乡录展示资料</view>
        <switch
          checked="{{profile.directoryVisible}}"
          disabled="{{saving || !canEdit}}"
          color="#36524E"
          bindchange="directory"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="muted small">切换后立即保存；关闭后资料不再出现在老乡录。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="error">{{submitError}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{canEdit}}" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">
      提交资料修改审核
    </button>
  </block>
  <view wx:elif="{{!loading && !error}}" class="empty">审核通过后可管理成员资料与隐私。</view>
</view>
